  "description": "Anthropic integration for TokenGuard on .NET 10. Converts prepared TokenGuard messages to Anthropic request parts and lets TokenGuard use Anthropic to summarize older history when context gets tight. Targets net10.0 only.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "TokenGuard.Extensions.Anthropic",
